up Baby & Toddler Room Setup Preparing for a baby nursery or upgrading your toddler to a new big room is exciting but can be equally overwhelming. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBabyproofing Your Relationship | Denver Couples Class for Parents (https://michellepagettherapy.com/babyproofing-your-relationship/)\nciteturn90search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3 weeks ago; Crawled: 3 weeks ago; \n## What is the Babyproofing Your Relationship class in Denver?\n\nIf you would rather do this with some guidance, and in a room with other couples in exactly the same season, Babyproofing Your Relationship is a two-hour class for expecting couples at Belly Bliss.\n\nThe class covers communication, dividing the labor (including the mental load), conflict and repair, intimacy, and staying connected through the newborn months. It is practical, it is warm, and it is usually funnier than you would expect from a room full of people discussing 3 a.m. resentment. You leave with a plan the two of you actually made together, not a handout you will lose in the diaper bag.\n\nNext date: Sunday, November 8th, 1 to 3 pm\nWhere: Belly Bliss, 300 Josephine St #230, Denver\nCost: $100 per couple\nRegistration: through Belly Bliss\n\nSee upcoming dates and register\n\nIf a couples class Denver families can drop into is not quite what you need right now, and you want individual support through pregnancy, Becoming is my guided program for the journey into motherhood, with one-to-one touchpoints built in.\n"
